# Winterspring - Recipes companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes whose source is physically in Winterspring (zone 1452),
# verified against the local Forever game data: 13 vendor-sold in Everlook
# and 10 dropped solely by in-zone mobs (see
# docs/winterspring-companions-inventory.md). Each step is gated to its
# profession; other characters skip it cleanly. Every buy line carries an npc
# pin to its in-zone vendor. No stock-class flag exists in the data, so
# nothing is marked limited. Meilosh's Timbermaw stock is excluded: he is
# Felwood-contracted and his recipes belong to the Felwood recipes companion.
# Blacksmithing, First Aid and Fishing have no in-zone source and say so
# below instead of padding. This guide never accepts or turns in.
guide butler-routes-completionist/winterspring-recipes
title Winterspring - Recipes & Patterns
levels 47-60
zone Winterspring
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords winterspring, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Alchemy — Everlook (Evie Whirlbrew)

  zone map 1452

  when skill Alchemy 1

  vendor 11188 -- Evie Whirlbrew (60.75, 37.78)
  buy 13480 "Recipe: Major Healing Potion" npc 11188
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

